  measured it at chance. RECOVERABLE is what an EXTERNAL observer can work
  out from the creature's OWN activity. The assembled readout decodes A from
  the motor space and B from the sensory space and predicts 'same' iff the two
  decodes AGREE. It uses the host's knowledge of which space carries which
  word, so it is an UPPER BOUND and never a claim about the creature -- its
